## Program Objectives

Development and deployment of a low-earth orbit satellite constellation for global communications and earth observation services.

### Key Deliverables
1. 48 LEO communication satellites
2. Ground station network (12 sites)
3. Mission control center
4. Customer access platform
5. Data analytics services

